Package: ggheat
Title: Publication-Ready Heatmaps with 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates publication-ready heatmaps from numeric matrices, wide
    data frames, or tidy long-form data. Supports row and column
    standardization, hierarchical clustering, cell labels, configurable
    colour scales, and an optional interactive 'Shiny' application.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://yaoxiangli.github.io/ggheat/,
    https://github.com/YaoxiangLi/ggheat
BugReports: https://github.com/YaoxiangLi/ggheat/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: 
    ggplot2,
    rlang
Suggests:
    config,
    golem,
    shiny,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
